.TH OSD-DESK-SNAKE-SETTINGS 1 "September 2026" "osd-desk-snake 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
osd-desk-snake-settings \- live settings for the OSD Desk Snake KWin script
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B osd-desk-snake-settings
.RI [ URL ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the settings of OSD Desk Snake, an on-screen indicator shown by KWin when
switching virtual desktops. Every change is saved right away to kwinrc (group
Script-osd-desk-snake) and shown on the indicator, which stays on screen while
the window is open and can be dragged to a new position.
.PP
Only one window runs at a time: a second launch brings the first one back.
The optional URL argument is ignored; it lets the osd-desk-snake:// link of the
System Settings page start the app.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/rcspam/osd-desk-snake
